;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r53" target="apiW"><mxGeometry x="0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="580" y="850"/><mxPoint x="2030" y="850"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="9" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.20408163265306123;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="apiE" target="grpE"><mxGeometry x="-0.45" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="10" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="grpE" target="dbE"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="9" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.20408163265306123;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="apiW" target="grpW"><mxGeometry x="-0.45" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="10" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="grpW" target="dbW"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="11" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="dbE" target="dbW"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1720" y="1475"/><mxPoint x="2790" y="1475"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e15" value="12" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pool" target="replica"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="960" y="590"/><mxPoint x="2030" y="590"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e16" value="13" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.3333333333333333;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gh" target="exec"><mxGeometry x="0.4" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="Legend and notes" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1920" width="2920" height="370" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legL" value="&lt;b&gt;Sites, sign-in and requests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[1] [2] The online banking app loads over HTTPS from its own CloudFront distribution, which reads a private S3 bucket through origin access control.&lt;br&gt;[3] [4] The read-only DR monitoring dashboard loads from a second distribution with its own private bucket.&lt;br&gt;[5] The browser signs in directly to the Cognito user pool (USER_PASSWORD_AUTH, no hosted UI) and keeps a 15-minute ID token (refresh 24 h); after a failover it signs in again against the replica in us-west-2 with the same pool and client IDs.&lt;br&gt;[6] The browser resolves the single API domain in Route 53 (dotted: DNS, about 60 s TTL) and sends Authorization: Bearer ID token.&lt;br&gt;[7] Weight 255: every call goes to the regional custom domain of the active region (us-east-2 at creation).&lt;br&gt;[8] Weight 0: the standby region receives nothing until the failover workflow moves the weights (dashed: standby).&lt;br&gt;[9] API Gateway validates the ID token with the native Cognito authorizer of its region and proxies to one of six functions, which re-check aud and token_use; only GET /health and the CORS preflight need no token. No API key and no usage plan.&lt;br&gt;[10] The functions reach Aurora on 5432 over TLS with IAM database authentication: create-transaction as app_writer, the other five as app_reader." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=15;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1970" width="1400" height="310" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legR" value="&lt;b&gt;Replication and delivery&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[11] Aurora Global Database replicates asynchronously from us-east-2 to us-west-2 (dotted); a planned switchover swaps the roles.&lt;br&gt;[12] Cognito multi-Region replication copies users and credentials from us-east-2 to the replica (dotted), encrypted with the customer managed multi-Region key and its replica key. The regional configuration attachment is INACTIVE at rest and ACTIVE during a failover.&lt;br&gt;[13] GitHub Actions assumes the organization role through OIDC and deploys every stack through the CloudFormation execution role. The drill workflows fence functions (reserved concurrency 0), switch the database over, toggle the replica attachment and move the weights; these control-plane calls are not drawn.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stacks: bootstrap (us-east-1 by hand; artifact bucket per data region), edge, cognito, network, database, api in us-east-2 and us-west-2, dns in us-east-1. Aurora: one db.r6g.large instance per region; the global cluster and the master secret are in the us-east-2 stack. Alarms: API 4XX, 5XX, Lambda errors and throttles, certificate expiry, replication lag, database CPU and connections, all to the SNS alert topic. Security groups: functions reach only the database; the database accepts only the function group. Solid arrow: synchronous request. Dotted arrow: DNS, standby path or asynchronous replication. Dashed group: owned by another repository." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=15;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="1970" width="1410" height="310" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>